# Terraform state, anywhere. infra/.gitignore covers the two stack directories, but a
# stray `terraform` run from the repo root writes state here -- and state files carry
# generated database passwords in clear text, so this must never depend on remembering
# which directory the command was run from.
terraform.tfstate
terraform.tfstate.backup
**/terraform.tfstate
**/terraform.tfstate.backup
**/.terraform/
